OL,3,GNEWSAFamily pay tribute to 'lovely dad'
OL,4,Afound dead
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have named a man found dead on a
OL,7,Fresidential street in Peterborough.
OL,9,FThe body of Anthony Daniel Pridmore,
OL,10,F64, of Dogsthorpe, was discovered in
OL,11,FCampion Road on Monday morning.
OL,12,FCambridgeshire Police were called to
OL,13,Fthe scene at about 07:15 BST.
OL,15,FOfficers said his death was being
OL,16,Ftreated as suspicious.
OL,18,FIn a statement, Pridmore's family
OL,19,Fdescribed him as a "lovely dad" who
OL,20,Fwould be missed.
